<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Encal Energy begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Encal Energy begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Friday it began coverage on the shares of Canadian oil company Encal Energy Ltd with a buy rating and a C$6 per share price target.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Tyler Dan said the company had good management and 20 percent annual long-term growth prospects.</p>
<p>-- &quot;They have gone through a pretty significant restructuring but I don't think the turnaround is over yet,&quot; Dan said.  &quot;They could also double their reserve base over the next 18 months based on their development and exploration projects.&quot;</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
